			            & "<div class='dt'" & ">" & "<em>" & [Status Meta] & "</em>" & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='bar'><i style='width:"
			            & FORMAT ( MIN ( MAX ( [Atingimento %], 0 ), 1.5 ) / 1.5 * 100, "0.0", "en-US" )
			            & "%;background:" & _c1 & "'></i><u style='left:66.7%'></u></div>"
			            & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='t g'><div class='lb'>Novos Clientes</div>"
			            & "<div class='vl'" & ">" & FORMAT ( [Novos Clientes], "#,0", "pt-BR" ) & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='dt'" & ">" & "<em>1ª compra no período</em>" & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='spk' style='color:#8FA98F'>" & _pt2 & "</div>"
			            & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='t'><div class='lb'>Margem</div>"
			            & "<div class='vl'" & ">" & FORMAT ( [Margem Bruta %], "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='dt'" & " style='color:" & _c3 & "'" & ">" & IF ( _d3 >= 0, "▲ ", "▼ " ) & FORMAT ( _d3, "0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " p.p. " & "<em>YoY</em>" & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='spk' style='color:#C8763C'>" & _pt3 & "</div>"
			            & "</div>"
			        & "</div>"
			RETURN
			    _html
		displayFolder: 17 Paineis HTML
		lineageTag: 4c4895a9-4237-672e-8e9b-22cf77c3145c

	/// Painel de KPIs da pagina 10 Finance.
	measure 'HTML Painel Financeiro' =
			VAR _fim = MAX ( dCalendario[Data] )
			VAR _serie =
			    ADDCOLUMNS (
			        CALCULATETABLE (
			            VALUES ( dCalendario[AnoMesNumero] ),
			            DATESINPERIOD ( dCalendario[Data], _fim, -12, MONTH )
			        ),
			        "@s1", CALCULATE ( [Recebido USD] )
			    )
			VAR _mn1 = MINX ( _serie, [@s1] )
			VAR _mx1 = MAXX ( _serie, [@s1] )
			VAR _pt1 =
			    CONCATENATEX (
			        _serie,
			        "<i style='height:"
			            & FORMAT ( 12 + DIVIDE ( [@s1] - _mn1, _mx1 - _mn1, 0.5 ) * 88, "0", "en-US" )
			            & "%'></i>",
			        "",
			        dCalendario[AnoMesNumero], ASC
			    )
			VAR _c4 = IF ( [Inadimplencia %] <= 0.02, "#1F8A70", IF ( [Inadimplencia %] <= 0.04, "#D9A441", "#C0453B" ) )
			
			VAR _css = "<style>
			*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
			html,body{height:100%;background:transparent;overflow:hidden}
			.ab{height:100%;display:grid;grid-auto-rows:1fr;gap:clamp(5px,.62vw,11px);font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif}
			.t{background:rgba(255,255,255,.65);border:1px solid rgba(227,224,217,.65);border-radius:clamp(5px,.6vw,9px);padding:clamp(6px,.7vw,11px) clamp(8px,.85vw,14px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.15em;overflow:hidden;position:relative}
			.t:before{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:3px;background:#C8763C;opacity:.9}
			.t.b:before{background:#17495A}
			.t.g:before{background:#8FA98F}
			.lb{font-size:clamp(7.5px,.66vw,10px);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5D6E75;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
			.vl{font-size:clamp(14px,1.6vw,26px);font-weight:700;color:#0E2A33;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.015em;white-space:nowrap}
			.dt{font-size:clamp(7.5px,.66vw,10px);font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.3em;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;color:#5D6E75}
			.dt em{font-style:normal;color:#8C96A5;font-weight:500}
			.spk{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:clamp(1px,.12vw,2.5px);flex:1;min-height:clamp(11px,1.3vw,24px);margin-top:.2em}
			.spk i{flex:1 1 0;background:currentColor;border-radius:1.5px 1.5px 0 0;opacity:.9;min-width:1px}
			.spk i:last-child{opacity:1}
			.bar{position:relative;height:clamp(4px,.4vw,7px);background:rgba(233,225,212,.7);border-radius:99px;margin-top:auto;overflow:hidden}
			.bar i{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;border-radius:99px}
			.bar u{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:1.5px;background:#0E2A33;opacity:.5}
			</style>"
			
			VAR _html =
			    _css
			        & "<div class='ab' style=""grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr)"">"
			        & "<div class='t'><div class='lb'>Contas a Receber</div>"
			            & "<div class='vl'" & ">" & IF ( ABS ( [Contas a Receber] ) >= 1E9, "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Contas a Receber] / 1E9, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Bi", "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Contas a Receber] / 1E6, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Mi" ) & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='dt'" & ">" & "<em>carteira total</em>" & "</div>"
			            & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='t b'><div class='lb'>Recebido</div>"
			            & "<div class='vl'" & ">" & IF ( ABS ( [Recebido USD] ) >= 1E9, "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Recebido USD] / 1E9, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Bi", "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Recebido USD] / 1E6, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Mi" ) & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='dt'" & ">" & "<em>já liquidado</em>" & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='spk' style='color:#17495A'>" & _pt1 & "</div>"
			            & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='t g'><div class='lb'>Saldo em Aberto</div>"
			            & "<div class='vl'" & ">" & IF ( ABS ( [Saldo em Aberto] ) >= 1E9, "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Saldo em Aberto] / 1E9, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Bi", "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Saldo em Aberto] / 1E6, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Mi" ) & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='dt'" & ">" & "<em>a vencer + vencido</em>" & "</div>"
			            & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='t'><div class='lb'>Saldo Vencido</div>"
			            & "<div class='vl'" & ">" & IF ( ABS ( [Saldo Vencido] ) >= 1E9, "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Saldo Vencido] / 1E9, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Bi", "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Saldo Vencido] / 1E6, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Mi" ) & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='dt'" & ">" & "<em>vencido + parcial</em>" & "</div>"
			            & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='t b'><div class='lb'>Inadimplência</div>"
			            & "<div class='vl'" & " style='color:" & _c4 & "'" & ">" & FORMAT ( [Inadimplencia %], "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='dt'" & ">" & "<em>vencido / carteira</em>" & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='bar'><i style='width:"
			            & FORMAT ( MIN ( MAX ( [Inadimplencia %], 0 ), 0.05 ) / 0.05 * 100, "0.0", "en-US" )
			            & "%;background:" & _c4 & "'></i><u style='left:40.0%'></u></div>"
			            & "</div>"
			        & "</div>"
			RETURN
			    _html
		displayFolder: 17 Paineis HTML
		lineageTag: 7e8eadf4-da78-991d-8d6e-3792d9c85563

	/// Painel de KPIs da pagina 11 Forecast e Budget.
	measure 'HTML Painel Forecast' =
			VAR _fim = MAX ( dCalendario[Data] )
			VAR _serie =
			    ADDCOLUMNS (
			        CALCULATETABLE (
			            VALUES ( dCalendario[AnoMesNumero] ),
			            DATESINPERIOD ( dCalendario[Data], _fim, -12, MONTH )
			        ),
			        "@s0", CALCULATE ( [Receita USD] )
			    )
			VAR _mn0 = MINX ( _serie, [@s0] )
			VAR _mx0 = MAXX ( _serie, [@s0] )
			VAR _pt0 =
			    CONCATENATEX (
			        _serie,
			        "<i style='height:"
			            & FORMAT ( 12 + DIVIDE ( [@s0] - _mn0, _mx0 - _mn0, 0.5 ) * 88, "0", "en-US" )
			            & "%'></i>",
			        "",
			        dCalendario[AnoMesNumero], ASC
			    )
			VAR _d0 = [Receita YoY %]
			VAR _c0 = IF ( _d0 >= 0, "#1F8A70", "#C0453B" )
			VAR _c3 = IF ( [Forecast Gap] >= 0, "#1F8A70", "#C0453B" )
			
			VAR _css = "<style>
			*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
			html,body{height:100%;background:transparent;overflow:hidden}
			.ab{height:100%;display:grid;grid-auto-rows:1fr;gap:clamp(5px,.62vw,11px);font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif}
			.t{background:rgba(255,255,255,.65);border:1px solid rgba(227,224,217,.65);border-radius:clamp(5px,.6vw,9px);padding:clamp(6px,.7vw,11px) clamp(8px,.85vw,14px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.15em;overflow:hidden;position:relative}
			.t:before{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:3px;background:#C8763C;opacity:.9}
			.t.b:before{background:#17495A}
			.t.g:before{background:#8FA98F}
			.lb{font-size:clamp(7.5px,.66vw,10px);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5D6E75;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
			.vl{font-size:clamp(14px,1.6vw,26px);font-weight:700;color:#0E2A33;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.015em;white-space:nowrap}
			.dt{font-size:clamp(7.5px,.66vw,10px);font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.3em;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;color:#5D6E75}
			.dt em{font-style:normal;color:#8C96A5;font-weight:500}
			.spk{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:clamp(1px,.12vw,2.5px);flex:1;min-height:clamp(11px,1.3vw,24px);margin-top:.2em}
			.spk i{flex:1 1 0;background:currentColor;border-radius:1.5px 1.5px 0 0;opacity:.9;min-width:1px}
			.spk i:last-child{opacity:1}
			.bar{position:relative;height:clamp(4px,.4vw,7px);background:rgba(233,225,212,.7);border-radius:99px;margin-top:auto;overflow:hidden}
			.bar i{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;border-radius:99px}
			.bar u{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:1.5px;background:#0E2A33;opacity:.5}
			</style>"
			
			VAR _html =
			    _css
			        & "<div class='ab' style=""grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr)"">"
			        & "<div class='t'><div class='lb'>Realizado</div>"
			            & "<div class='vl'" & ">" & IF ( ABS ( [Receita USD] ) >= 1E9, "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Receita USD] / 1E9, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Bi", "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Receita USD] / 1E6, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Mi" ) & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='dt'" & " style='color:" & _c0 & "'" & ">" & IF ( _d0 >= 0, "▲ ", "▼ " ) & FORMAT ( _d0, "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & " " & "<em>vs ano anterior</em>" & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='spk' style='color:#C8763C'>" & _pt0 & "</div>"
			            & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='t b'><div class='lb'>Orçado</div>"
			            & "<div class='vl'" & ">" & IF ( ABS ( [Receita Orcada USD] ) >= 1E9, "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Receita Orcada USD] / 1E9, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Bi", "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Receita Orcada USD] / 1E6, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Mi" ) & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='dt'" & ">" & "<em>" & FORMAT([Actual vs Budget %],"0.0%","pt-BR") & " do orçado</em>" & "</div>"
			            & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='t g'><div class='lb'>Forecast</div>"
			            & "<div class='vl'" & ">" & IF ( ABS ( [Receita Forecast USD] ) >= 1E9, "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Receita Forecast USD] / 1E9, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Bi", "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Receita Forecast USD] / 1E6, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Mi" ) & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='dt'" & ">" & "<em>última revisão</em>" & "</div>"
			            & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='t'><div class='lb'>Gap Forecast</div>"
			            & "<div class='vl'" & ">" & IF ( ABS ( [Forecast Gap] ) >= 1E9, "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Forecast Gap] / 1E9, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Bi", "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Forecast Gap] / 1E6, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Mi" ) & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='dt'" & " style='color:" & _c3 & "'" & ">" & "<em>forecast − realizado</em>" & "</div>"
			            & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='t b'><div class='lb'>Projeção do Ano</div>"
			            & "<div class='vl'" & ">" & IF ( ABS ( [Projecao Fechamento Ano] ) >= 1E9, "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Projecao Fechamento Ano] / 1E9, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Bi", "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Projecao Fechamento Ano] / 1E6, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Mi" ) & "</div>"
			            & "<div class='dt'" & ">" & "<em>linear sobre o realizado</em>" & "</div>"
			            & "</div>"
			        & "</div>"
			RETURN
			    _html
		displayFolder: 17 Paineis HTML
		lineageTag: f27d5137-35a4-86a4-beeb-7c0d491df7c2

	/// Tooltip HTML de cliente.
	measure 'HTML Tooltip Cliente' =
			VAR _fim = MAX ( dCalendario[Data] )
			VAR _nome = SELECTEDVALUE ( dCliente[RazaoSocial], "Vários clientes" )
			VAR _pais = SELECTEDVALUE ( dCliente[Pais], "—" )
			VAR _seg = SELECTEDVALUE ( dCliente[Segmento], "—" )
			VAR _porte = SELECTEDVALUE ( dCliente[Porte], "—" )
			VAR _canal = SELECTEDVALUE ( dCliente[CanalVenda], "—" )
			VAR _rfv = [Segmento RFV]
			VAR _abc = [Classe ABC Cliente]
			VAR _yoy = [Receita YoY %]
			VAR _sow = [Share of Wallet]
			VAR _rec = [Recencia Dias]
			VAR _cor = IF ( _yoy >= 0, "#1F8A70", "#C0453B" )
			VAR _serie0 =
			    ADDCOLUMNS (
			        CALCULATETABLE (
			            VALUES ( dCalendario[AnoMesNumero] ),
			            DATESINPERIOD ( dCalendario[Data], _fim, -12, MONTH )
			        ),
			        "@v", CALCULATE ( [Receita USD] )
			    )
			VAR _mn0 = MINX ( _serie0, [@v] )
			VAR _mx0 = MAXX ( _serie0, [@v] )
			VAR _spk0 =
			    CONCATENATEX (
			        _serie0,
			        "<i style='height:"
			            & FORMAT ( 14 + DIVIDE ( [@v] - _mn0, _mx0 - _mn0, 0.5 ) * 86, "0", "en-US" )
			            & "%'></i>",
			        "",
			        dCalendario[AnoMesNumero], ASC
			    )
			
			VAR _css = "<style>
			*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
			html,body{height:100%;background:transparent;overflow:hidden}
			.tt{height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;padding:2px;
			    font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#16262C}
			.hd{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;
			    border-left:3px solid #C8763C;padding-left:7px}
			.hd h1{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#0E2A33;line-height:1.15;
			    white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;max-width:200px}
			.hd .tag{font-size:8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;
			    padding:2px 6px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(200,118,60,.16);color:#8A4F26;white-space:nowrap}
			.sub{font-size:8.5px;color:#8C96A5;margin:-3px 0 0 10px;
			     white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
			.kp{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:4px}
			.kp div{background:rgba(255,255,255,.72);border:1px solid rgba(227,224,217,.8);
			        border-radius:5px;padding:4px 5px;overflow:hidden}
			.kp span{display:block;font-size:7.5px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;
			         color:#5D6E75;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
			.kp b{display:block;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#0E2A33;line-height:1.2;white-space:nowrap}
			.sec{font-size:7.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8C96A5;font-weight:700;margin-top:1px}
			.spk{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:1.5px;height:30px}
			.spk i{flex:1 1 0;background:#C8763C;border-radius:1.5px 1.5px 0 0;opacity:.55;min-width:1px}
			.spk i:last-child{opacity:1}
			.rows{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px}
			.r{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:9px}
			.r em{font-style:normal;color:#5D6E75;flex:0 0 82px;white-space:nowrap;
			      overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
			.r .tr{flex:1;height:6px;background:rgba(233,225,212,.75);border-radius:99px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
			.r .tr i{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;border-radius:99px}
			.r b{flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0E2A33;font-size:9px;min-width:42px;text-align:right}
			.ft{margin-top:auto;font-size:7.5px;color:#8C96A5;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;
			    border-top:1px solid rgba(227,224,217,.7);padding-top:4px}
			.ft b{color:#16262C;font-weight:600}
			</style>"
			
			VAR _html =
			    _css
			        & "<div class='tt'>"
			        & "<div class='hd'><h1>" & _nome & "</h1><span class='tag'>" & _rfv & "</span></div>"
			        & "<div class='sub'>" & _pais & " · " & _seg & " · porte " & _porte & " · " & _canal & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='kp'>"
			            & "<div><span>Receita</span><b>" & IF ( ABS ( [Receita USD] ) >= 1E6, "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Receita USD] / 1E6, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Mi", "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Receita USD] / 1E3, "#,0", "pt-BR" ) & " k" ) & "</b></div>"
			            & "<div><span>Margem</span><b>" & FORMAT ( [Margem Bruta %], "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & "</b></div>"
			            & "<div><span>Pedidos</span><b>" & FORMAT ( [Pedidos], "#,0", "pt-BR" ) & "</b></div>"
			            & "<div><span>Ticket</span><b>" & IF ( ABS ( [Ticket Medio USD] ) >= 1E6, "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Ticket Medio USD] / 1E6, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Mi", "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Ticket Medio USD] / 1E3, "#,0", "pt-BR" ) & " k" ) & "</b></div>"
			        & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='sec'>Receita — últimos 12 meses</div>"
			        & "<div class='spk'>" & _spk0 & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='rows'>"
			            & "<div class='r'><em>Share of Wallet</em><div class='tr'><i style='width:"
			            & FORMAT ( MIN ( MAX ( _sow, 0 ), 1 ) * 100, "0", "en-US" )
			            & "%;background:" & "#C8763C" & "'></i></div><b>" & FORMAT ( _sow, "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & "</b></div>"
			            & "<div class='r'><em>Classe ABC</em><div class='tr'><i style='width:"
			            & FORMAT ( MIN ( MAX ( SWITCH ( _abc, "A", 1, "B", 0.6, 0.3 ), 0 ), 1 ) * 100, "0", "en-US" )
			            & "%;background:" & "#17495A" & "'></i></div><b>" & _abc & "</b></div>"
			        & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='ft'><span>Última compra <b>" & FORMAT ( [Data Ultima Compra], "dd/mm/yy", "pt-BR" ) & "</b> · " & FORMAT ( _rec, "#,0", "pt-BR" ) & " d</span>"
			            & "<span style='color:" & _cor & "'>" & IF ( _yoy >= 0, "▲", "▼" ) & " " & FORMAT ( _yoy, "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & " YoY</span></div>"
			        & "</div>"
			RETURN
			    _html
		displayFolder: 17 Paineis HTML
		lineageTag: 1d718b2a-6e3b-3d1b-19b9-6eb8ce006491

	/// Tooltip HTML de produto.
	measure 'HTML Tooltip Produto' =
			VAR _fim = MAX ( dCalendario[Data] )
			VAR _nome = SELECTEDVALUE ( dProduto[Produto], "Vários produtos" )
			VAR _sku = SELECTEDVALUE ( dProduto[SKU], "—" )
			VAR _cat = SELECTEDVALUE ( dProduto[Categoria], "—" )
			VAR _linha = SELECTEDVALUE ( dProduto[Linha], "—" )
			VAR _emb = SELECTEDVALUE ( dProduto[TipoEmbalagem], "—" )
			VAR _origem = SELECTEDVALUE ( dProduto[EstadoOrigem], "—" )
			VAR _alvo = SELECTEDVALUE ( dProduto[MargemAlvo], BLANK () )
			VAR _abc = [Classe ABC Produto]
			VAR _mrg = [Margem Bruta %]
			VAR _yoy = [Receita YoY %]
			VAR _cor = IF ( _yoy >= 0, "#1F8A70", "#C0453B" )
			VAR _corMrg = IF ( _mrg >= _alvo, "#1F8A70", "#C0453B" )
			VAR _serie0 =
			    ADDCOLUMNS (
			        CALCULATETABLE (
			            VALUES ( dCalendario[AnoMesNumero] ),
			            DATESINPERIOD ( dCalendario[Data], _fim, -12, MONTH )
			        ),
			        "@v", CALCULATE ( [Receita USD] )
			    )
			VAR _mn0 = MINX ( _serie0, [@v] )
			VAR _mx0 = MAXX ( _serie0, [@v] )
			VAR _spk0 =
			    CONCATENATEX (
			        _serie0,
			        "<i style='height:"
			            & FORMAT ( 14 + DIVIDE ( [@v] - _mn0, _mx0 - _mn0, 0.5 ) * 86, "0", "en-US" )
			            & "%'></i>",
			        "",
			        dCalendario[AnoMesNumero], ASC
			    )
			
			VAR _css = "<style>
			*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
			html,body{height:100%;background:transparent;overflow:hidden}
			.tt{height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;padding:2px;
			    font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#16262C}
			.hd{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;
			    border-left:3px solid #C8763C;padding-left:7px}
			.hd h1{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#0E2A33;line-height:1.15;
			    white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;max-width:200px}
			.hd .tag{font-size:8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;
			    padding:2px 6px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(200,118,60,.16);color:#8A4F26;white-space:nowrap}
			.sub{font-size:8.5px;color:#8C96A5;margin:-3px 0 0 10px;
			     white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
			.kp{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:4px}
			.kp div{background:rgba(255,255,255,.72);border:1px solid rgba(227,224,217,.8);
			        border-radius:5px;padding:4px 5px;overflow:hidden}
			.kp span{display:block;font-size:7.5px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;
			         color:#5D6E75;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
			.kp b{display:block;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#0E2A33;line-height:1.2;white-space:nowrap}
			.sec{font-size:7.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8C96A5;font-weight:700;margin-top:1px}
			.spk{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:1.5px;height:30px}
			.spk i{flex:1 1 0;background:#C8763C;border-radius:1.5px 1.5px 0 0;opacity:.55;min-width:1px}
			.spk i:last-child{opacity:1}
			.rows{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px}
			.r{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:9px}
			.r em{font-style:normal;color:#5D6E75;flex:0 0 82px;white-space:nowrap;
			      overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
			.r .tr{flex:1;height:6px;background:rgba(233,225,212,.75);border-radius:99px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
			.r .tr i{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;border-radius:99px}
			.r b{flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0E2A33;font-size:9px;min-width:42px;text-align:right}
			.ft{margin-top:auto;font-size:7.5px;color:#8C96A5;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;
			    border-top:1px solid rgba(227,224,217,.7);padding-top:4px}
			.ft b{color:#16262C;font-weight:600}
			</style>"
			
			VAR _html =
			    _css
			        & "<div class='tt'>"
			        & "<div class='hd'><h1>" & _nome & "</h1><span class='tag'>ABC " & _abc & "</span></div>"
			        & "<div class='sub'>" & _sku & " · " & _cat & " · " & _linha & " · " & _emb & " · " & _origem & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='kp'>"
			            & "<div><span>Receita</span><b>" & IF ( ABS ( [Receita USD] ) >= 1E6, "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Receita USD] / 1E6, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Mi", "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Receita USD] / 1E3, "#,0", "pt-BR" ) & " k" ) & "</b></div>"
			            & "<div><span>Margem</span><b>" & FORMAT ( _mrg, "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & "</b></div>"
			            & "<div><span>Volume</span><b>" & FORMAT ( [Toneladas], "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " t</b></div>"
			            & "<div><span>US$/kg</span><b>" & FORMAT ( [Preco Medio por Kg], "#,0.00", "pt-BR" ) & "</b></div>"
			        & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='sec'>Receita — últimos 12 meses</div>"
			        & "<div class='spk'>" & _spk0 & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='rows'>"
			            & "<div class='r'><em>Margem alvo</em><div class='tr'><i style='width:"
			            & FORMAT ( MIN ( MAX ( _alvo, 0 ), 1 ) * 100, "0", "en-US" )
			            & "%;background:" & "#8FA98F" & "'></i></div><b>" & FORMAT ( _alvo, "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & "</b></div>"
			            & "<div class='r'><em>Margem real</em><div class='tr'><i style='width:"
			            & FORMAT ( MIN ( MAX ( _mrg, 0 ), 1 ) * 100, "0", "en-US" )
			            & "%;background:" & _corMrg & "'></i></div><b>" & FORMAT ( _mrg, "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & "</b></div>"
			        & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='ft'><span>Margem/kg <b>US$ " & FORMAT ( [Margem por Kg], "#,0.00", "pt-BR" ) & "</b></span>"
			            & "<span style='color:" & _cor & "'>" & IF ( _yoy >= 0, "▲", "▼" ) & " " & FORMAT ( _yoy, "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & " YoY</span></div>"
			        & "</div>"
			RETURN
			    _html
		displayFolder: 17 Paineis HTML
		lineageTag: d22251bd-22b2-93b2-9cb5-4f03d697be80

	/// Tooltip HTML de mercado.
	measure 'HTML Tooltip Pais' =
			VAR _fim = MAX ( dCalendario[Data] )
			VAR _nome = SELECTEDVALUE ( dPais[Pais], "Vários mercados" )
			VAR _cont = SELECTEDVALUE ( dPais[Continente], "—" )
			VAR _reg = SELECTEDVALUE ( dPais[Regiao], "—" )
			VAR _class = SELECTEDVALUE ( dPais[ClassificacaoMercado], "—" )
			VAR _risco = SELECTEDVALUE ( dPais[RiscoPais], "—" )
			VAR _tarifa = SELECTEDVALUE ( dPais[TarifaMediaImportacao], BLANK () )
			VAR _otif = [OTIF %]
			VAR _atr = [% Embarques Atrasados]
			VAR _yoy = [Receita YoY %]
			VAR _cor = IF ( _yoy >= 0, "#1F8A70", "#C0453B" )
			VAR _corOtif = IF ( _otif >= 0.9, "#1F8A70", IF ( _otif >= 0.8, "#D9A441", "#C0453B" ) )
			VAR _serie0 =
			    ADDCOLUMNS (
			        CALCULATETABLE (
			            VALUES ( dCalendario[AnoMesNumero] ),
			            DATESINPERIOD ( dCalendario[Data], _fim, -12, MONTH )
			        ),
			        "@v", CALCULATE ( [Receita USD] )
			    )
			VAR _mn0 = MINX ( _serie0, [@v] )
			VAR _mx0 = MAXX ( _serie0, [@v] )
			VAR _spk0 =
			    CONCATENATEX (
			        _serie0,
			        "<i style='height:"
			            & FORMAT ( 14 + DIVIDE ( [@v] - _mn0, _mx0 - _mn0, 0.5 ) * 86, "0", "en-US" )
			            & "%'></i>",
			        "",
			        dCalendario[AnoMesNumero], ASC
			    )
			
			VAR _css = "<style>
			*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
			html,body{height:100%;background:transparent;overflow:hidden}
			.tt{height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;padding:2px;
			    font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#16262C}
			.hd{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;
			    border-left:3px solid #C8763C;padding-left:7px}
			.hd h1{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#0E2A33;line-height:1.15;
			    white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;max-width:200px}
			.hd .tag{font-size:8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;
			    padding:2px 6px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(200,118,60,.16);color:#8A4F26;white-space:nowrap}
			.sub{font-size:8.5px;color:#8C96A5;margin:-3px 0 0 10px;
			     white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
			.kp{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:4px}
			.kp div{background:rgba(255,255,255,.72);border:1px solid rgba(227,224,217,.8);
			        border-radius:5px;padding:4px 5px;overflow:hidden}
			.kp span{display:block;font-size:7.5px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;
			         color:#5D6E75;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
			.kp b{display:block;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#0E2A33;line-height:1.2;white-space:nowrap}
			.sec{font-size:7.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8C96A5;font-weight:700;margin-top:1px}
			.spk{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:1.5px;height:30px}
			.spk i{flex:1 1 0;background:#C8763C;border-radius:1.5px 1.5px 0 0;opacity:.55;min-width:1px}
			.spk i:last-child{opacity:1}
			.rows{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px}
			.r{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:9px}
			.r em{font-style:normal;color:#5D6E75;flex:0 0 82px;white-space:nowrap;
			      overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
			.r .tr{flex:1;height:6px;background:rgba(233,225,212,.75);border-radius:99px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
			.r .tr i{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;border-radius:99px}
			.r b{flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0E2A33;font-size:9px;min-width:42px;text-align:right}
			.ft{margin-top:auto;font-size:7.5px;color:#8C96A5;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;
			    border-top:1px solid rgba(227,224,217,.7);padding-top:4px}
			.ft b{color:#16262C;font-weight:600}
			</style>"
			
			VAR _html =
			    _css
			        & "<div class='tt'>"
			        & "<div class='hd'><h1>" & _nome & "</h1><span class='tag'>" & _class & "</span></div>"
			        & "<div class='sub'>" & _cont & " · " & _reg & " · risco " & _risco & " · tarifa " & FORMAT ( _tarifa, "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='kp'>"
			            & "<div><span>Receita</span><b>" & IF ( ABS ( [Receita USD] ) >= 1E6, "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Receita USD] / 1E6, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Mi", "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Receita USD] / 1E3, "#,0", "pt-BR" ) & " k" ) & "</b></div>"
			            & "<div><span>Margem</span><b>" & FORMAT ( [Margem Bruta %], "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & "</b></div>"
			            & "<div><span>Volume</span><b>" & FORMAT ( [Toneladas], "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " t</b></div>"
			            & "<div><span>Clientes</span><b>" & FORMAT ( [Clientes Ativos], "#,0", "pt-BR" ) & "</b></div>"
			        & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='sec'>Receita — últimos 12 meses</div>"
			        & "<div class='spk'>" & _spk0 & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='rows'>"
			            & "<div class='r'><em>OTIF</em><div class='tr'><i style='width:"
			            & FORMAT ( MIN ( MAX ( _otif, 0 ), 1 ) * 100, "0", "en-US" )
			            & "%;background:" & _corOtif & "'></i></div><b>" & FORMAT ( _otif, "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & "</b></div>"
			            & "<div class='r'><em>Embarq. atraso</em><div class='tr'><i style='width:"
			            & FORMAT ( MIN ( MAX ( _atr, 0 ), 1 ) * 100, "0", "en-US" )
			            & "%;background:" & "#C8763C" & "'></i></div><b>" & FORMAT ( _atr, "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & "</b></div>"
			        & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='ft'><span>Lead time <b>" & FORMAT ( [Lead Time Real], "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " d</b> · frete US$ " & FORMAT ( [Frete por Kg], "#,0.00", "pt-BR" ) & "/kg</span>"
			            & "<span style='color:" & _cor & "'>" & IF ( _yoy >= 0, "▲", "▼" ) & " " & FORMAT ( _yoy, "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & " YoY</span></div>"
			        & "</div>"
			RETURN
			    _html
		displayFolder: 17 Paineis HTML
		lineageTag: cea7a659-53e7-221e-2702-daff9b2b20cc

	/// Tooltip HTML de vendedor.
	measure 'HTML Tooltip Vendedor' =
			VAR _fim = MAX ( dCalendario[Data] )
			VAR _nome = SELECTEDVALUE ( dVendedor[NomeVendedor], "Vários vendedores" )
			VAR _cargo = SELECTEDVALUE ( dVendedor[Cargo], "—" )
			VAR _ger = SELECTEDVALUE ( dVendedor[Gerente], "—" )
			VAR _reg = SELECTEDVALUE ( dVendedor[RegiaoResponsavel], "—" )
			VAR _at = [Atingimento %]
			VAR _conc = [Concentracao Carteira Vendedor]
			VAR _status = [Status Meta]
			VAR _yoy = [Receita YoY %]
			VAR _cor = IF ( _yoy >= 0, "#1F8A70", "#C0453B" )
			VAR _corAt = IF ( _at >= 1, "#1F8A70", IF ( _at >= 0.9, "#D9A441", "#C0453B" ) )
			VAR _corConc = IF ( _conc >= 0.4, "#C0453B", IF ( _conc >= 0.25, "#D9A441", "#1F8A70" ) )
			VAR _serie0 =
			    ADDCOLUMNS (
			        CALCULATETABLE (
			            VALUES ( dCalendario[AnoMesNumero] ),
			            DATESINPERIOD ( dCalendario[Data], _fim, -12, MONTH )
			        ),
			        "@v", CALCULATE ( [Receita USD] )
			    )
			VAR _mn0 = MINX ( _serie0, [@v] )
			VAR _mx0 = MAXX ( _serie0, [@v] )
			VAR _spk0 =
			    CONCATENATEX (
			        _serie0,
			        "<i style='height:"
			            & FORMAT ( 14 + DIVIDE ( [@v] - _mn0, _mx0 - _mn0, 0.5 ) * 86, "0", "en-US" )
			            & "%'></i>",
			        "",
			        dCalendario[AnoMesNumero], ASC
			    )
			
			VAR _css = "<style>
			*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
			html,body{height:100%;background:transparent;overflow:hidden}
			.tt{height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;padding:2px;
			    font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#16262C}
			.hd{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;
			    border-left:3px solid #C8763C;padding-left:7px}
			.hd h1{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#0E2A33;line-height:1.15;
			    white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;max-width:200px}
			.hd .tag{font-size:8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;
			    padding:2px 6px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(200,118,60,.16);color:#8A4F26;white-space:nowrap}
			.sub{font-size:8.5px;color:#8C96A5;margin:-3px 0 0 10px;
			     white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
			.kp{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:4px}
			.kp div{background:rgba(255,255,255,.72);border:1px solid rgba(227,224,217,.8);
			        border-radius:5px;padding:4px 5px;overflow:hidden}
			.kp span{display:block;font-size:7.5px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;
			         color:#5D6E75;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
			.kp b{display:block;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#0E2A33;line-height:1.2;white-space:nowrap}
			.sec{font-size:7.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8C96A5;font-weight:700;margin-top:1px}
			.spk{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:1.5px;height:30px}
			.spk i{flex:1 1 0;background:#C8763C;border-radius:1.5px 1.5px 0 0;opacity:.55;min-width:1px}
			.spk i:last-child{opacity:1}
			.rows{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px}
			.r{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:9px}
			.r em{font-style:normal;color:#5D6E75;flex:0 0 82px;white-space:nowrap;
			      overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
			.r .tr{flex:1;height:6px;background:rgba(233,225,212,.75);border-radius:99px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
			.r .tr i{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;border-radius:99px}
			.r b{flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;color:#0E2A33;font-size:9px;min-width:42px;text-align:right}
			.ft{margin-top:auto;font-size:7.5px;color:#8C96A5;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;
			    border-top:1px solid rgba(227,224,217,.7);padding-top:4px}
			.ft b{color:#16262C;font-weight:600}
			</style>"
			
			VAR _html =
			    _css
			        & "<div class='tt'>"
			        & "<div class='hd'><h1>" & _nome & "</h1><span class='tag'>" & _status & "</span></div>"
			        & "<div class='sub'>" & _cargo & " · " & _reg & " · reporta a " & _ger & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='kp'>"
			            & "<div><span>Receita</span><b>" & IF ( ABS ( [Receita USD] ) >= 1E6, "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Receita USD] / 1E6, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Mi", "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Receita USD] / 1E3, "#,0", "pt-BR" ) & " k" ) & "</b></div>"
			            & "<div><span>Meta</span><b>" & IF ( ABS ( [Meta Receita USD] ) >= 1E6, "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Meta Receita USD] / 1E6, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Mi", "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Meta Receita USD] / 1E3, "#,0", "pt-BR" ) & " k" ) & "</b></div>"
			            & "<div><span>Clientes</span><b>" & FORMAT ( [Clientes Ativos], "#,0", "pt-BR" ) & "</b></div>"
			            & "<div><span>Margem</span><b>" & FORMAT ( [Margem Bruta %], "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & "</b></div>"
			        & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='sec'>Receita — últimos 12 meses</div>"
			        & "<div class='spk'>" & _spk0 & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='rows'>"
			            & "<div class='r'><em>Atingimento</em><div class='tr'><i style='width:"
			            & FORMAT ( MIN ( MAX ( DIVIDE ( _at, 1.5 ), 0 ), 1 ) * 100, "0", "en-US" )
			            & "%;background:" & _corAt & "'></i></div><b>" & FORMAT ( _at, "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & "</b></div>"
			            & "<div class='r'><em>Maior cliente</em><div class='tr'><i style='width:"
			            & FORMAT ( MIN ( MAX ( _conc, 0 ), 1 ) * 100, "0", "en-US" )
			            & "%;background:" & _corConc & "'></i></div><b>" & FORMAT ( _conc, "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & "</b></div>"
			        & "</div>"
			        & "<div class='ft'><span>Gap <b>" & IF ( ABS ( [Gap Meta USD] ) >= 1E6, "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Gap Meta USD] / 1E6, "#,0.0", "pt-BR" ) & " Mi", "US$ " & FORMAT ( [Gap Meta USD] / 1E3, "#,0", "pt-BR" ) & " k" ) & "</b> · novos " & FORMAT ( [Novos Clientes], "#,0", "pt-BR" ) & "</span>"
			            & "<span style='color:" & _cor & "'>" & IF ( _yoy >= 0, "▲", "▼" ) & " " & FORMAT ( _yoy, "0.0%", "pt-BR" ) & " YoY</span></div>"
			        & "</div>"
			RETURN
			    _html
		displayFolder: 17 Paineis HTML
		lineageTag: 102d00f5-8bf2-3e8a-cdee-dcfb1b2ac118

	measure 'HTML Rotas Globais Animadas' =
			
			VAR _HTML =
			"
			<div style='
			    width:100%;
			    height:100%;
			    overflow:hidden;
			    background:transparent;
			    position:relative;
			'>
			
			<style>
			
			.auroraRoute {
			    fill:none;
			    stroke-linecap:round;
			    stroke-linejoin:round;
			    stroke-dasharray:12 15;
			    animation:moveRoute 5s linear infinite;
			}
			
			.auroraRoute2 {
			    fill:none;
			    stroke-linecap:round;
			    stroke-linejoin:round;
			    stroke-dasharray:5 14;
			    animation:moveRoute2 8s linear infinite;
			}
			
			@keyframes moveRoute {
			    from {
			        stroke-dashoffset:0;
			    }
			    to {
			        stroke-dashoffset:-270;
			    }
			}
			
			@keyframes moveRoute2 {
			    from {
			        stroke-dashoffset:0;
			    }
			    to {
			        stroke-dashoffset:-190;
			    }
			}
			
			.hubPulse {
			    transform-box:fill-box;
			    transform-origin:center;
			    animation:pulseHub 2.5s ease-out infinite;
			}
			
			@keyframes pulseHub {
			    0% {
			        opacity:.80;
			        transform:scale(.4);
			    }
			
			    70% {
			        opacity:.18;
			        transform:scale(2);
			    }
			
			    100% {
			        opacity:0;
			        transform:scale(2.5);
			    }
			}
			
			.destinationPulse {
			    animation:destinationGlow 2.8s ease-in-out infinite;
			}
			
			@keyframes destinationGlow {
			    0%,100% {
			        opacity:.45;
			    }
			
			    50% {
			        opacity:1;
			    }
			}
			
			</style>
			
			
			<svg
			    width='100%'
			    height='100%'
			    viewBox='0 0 1600 900'
			    preserveAspectRatio='xMidYMid meet'
			    xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'>
			
			<defs>
			
			    <linearGradient
			        id='goldRoute'
			        x1='0%'
			        y1='100%'
			        x2='100%'
			        y2='0%'>
			
			        <stop
			            offset='0%'
			            stop-color='#A97929'
			            stop-opacity='.20'/>
			
			        <stop
			            offset='45%'
			            stop-color='#D6A84C'
			            stop-opacity='.75'/>
			
			        <stop
			            offset='70%'
			            stop-color='#FFE08B'
			            stop-opacity='1'/>
			
			        <stop
			            offset='100%'
			            stop-color='#C99132'
			            stop-opacity='.35'/>
			
			    </linearGradient>
			
			
			    <linearGradient
			        id='tealRoute'
			        x1='0%'
			        y1='100%'
			        x2='100%'
			        y2='0%'>
			
			        <stop
			            offset='0%'
			            stop-color='#0B5554'
			            stop-opacity='.10'/>
			
			        <stop
			            offset='50%'
			            stop-color='#65C1BA'
			            stop-opacity='.60'/>
			
